Write a function to find the longest substring of a given string with all distinct characters. The function should return the length of the longest such substring.

The function `longest_distinct_subsequence/1` takes a single string argument and returns a non-negative integer. If the string is empty, return 0. The function should run in O(n) time where n is the length of the string.

---TEST---
